      "Paha Luar (Abductors)",
      "Paha Dalam (Adductors)",
      "Betis (Calves)",
      "Bokong (Glutes)",
      "Paha Belakang (Hamstrings)"
    ],
    "equipmentSetup": [
      "Sesuaikan posisi bantalan, pin beban, atau pegangan alat sesuai postur tubuh.",
      "Pastikan tumpukan beban terkunci aman sebelum memulai repetisi."
    ],
    "instructions": [
      "Set up a row of cones or other small barriers, placing them a few feet apart.",
      "Stand in front of the first cone with your feet shoulder width apart. This will be your starting position.",
      "Begin by jumping with both feet over the first cone, swinging both arms as you jump.",
      "Absorb the impact of landing by bending the knees, rebounding out of the first leap by jumping over the next cone.",
      "Continue until you have jumped over all of the cones."
    ],
    "dosAndDonts": {
      "dos": [
        "Jaga postur punggung tetap netral dan kontrol kecepatan gerakan."
      ],
      "donts": [
        "Hindari menggunakan momentum tubuh berlebih saat mengangkat beban."
      ]
    },
    "coachCues": {
      "max": "Fokus ke otot target lo bro! Rasain kontraksinya di setiap repetisi. Gas!",
      "mia": "Kontrol gerakannya perlahan ya, rasakan aktivasi otot dengan napas teratur. ✨"
    },
    "recommendedSetsReps": "3-4 Set x 10-12 Repetisi",
